Code Documentation and Security



Overview

The team discussed the importance of adding comments to methods for future maintenance and standardizing documentation. They confirmed that the application underwent security scanning and performance testing, showing no significant overhead. The team requested an update to the OpenTelemetry NuGet package from version 1.15 to 1.17. They also addressed the need for real-time monitoring and the potential use of Dynatrace for performance alerts. The plan includes monitoring performance data, possibly pushing it to Elasticsearch (ELK) for analysis, and considering a purge process for data retention. The next steps involve updating the NuGet package and addressing the feedback.



